There's a tunnel here that runs
from the house underneath the river

49:40.600 --> 49:42.240
to an underground strong room.

49:42.320 --> 49:45.000
Now, this used to be the palace treasury.

49:45.080 --> 49:48.360
The tunnel runs directly west
and it's separated from the house

49:48.440 --> 49:52.120
by three iron doors with locks
we can't open.

49:52.200 --> 49:57.120
We need our tunnel to run from here
and hit the strong room direct.

49:59.960 --> 50:00.960
[keys jingling]

50:12.640 --> 50:13.840
[door opens]

50:37.400 --> 50:39.800
Primrose Hill 23. Ada Thorne.

50:42.320 --> 50:43.920
Ada?

50:44.000 --> 50:45.280
Is Michael still there?

50:49.520 --> 50:52.240
Right, would you tell him
that I have taken the car?

50:52.320 --> 50:53.520
He can take the train.

50:54.920 --> 50:58.000
Will you try and find out
why he's been so bloody sour lately?

50:59.640 --> 51:00.640
[phone clicks]

51:25.560 --> 51:26.560
[door opens]

52:11.000 --> 52:12.080
[Tommy clears throat]

52:19.600 --> 52:20.600
[sighs]

52:39.360 --> 52:42.600
You shouldn't go looking through
other people's private things.

52:42.680 --> 52:43.800
He's my son.

52:45.640 --> 52:48.280
The bullet was mine.
I never got a chance to fire it.

52:48.360 --> 52:51.920
And the gypsy rules
say it must be passed on…

52:52.000 --> 52:54.720
It's not about rules, Pol.
It's about he asked me.

52:57.240 --> 53:00.480
It's about he told me
why he wanted to do it.

53:01.520 --> 53:05.560
And if I tell you,
I can't take the knowledge back.

53:08.560 --> 53:09.720
Better off without it.

53:14.440 --> 53:16.000
So this is when he was with the parish…

53:16.080 --> 53:17.280
Better off without it, Pol.

53:29.840 --> 53:31.920
This is when he was with the fathers.

53:32.760 --> 53:35.320
This is when he was in the care
of the holy fathers.

53:36.880 --> 53:39.000
Michael wants it that you don't know.

53:49.720 --> 53:50.720
That priest…

53:50.800 --> 53:56.280
That priest who was there
when he was taken in,

53:57.200 --> 53:59.600
and who is still
walking the fucking earth.

53:59.680 --> 54:00.680
Fuck…

54:09.960 --> 54:12.240
-Fuck…
-He asked me, Pol,

54:12.320 --> 54:13.840
and I said yes.

54:18.920 --> 54:24.280
And I said, "You put a bullet
in that fucker's brains."

54:26.840 --> 54:28.760
By order of the Peaky Blinders.

54:34.760 --> 54:35.880
[sniffles]

54:36.920 --> 54:37.960
[sighs]

54:41.560 --> 54:42.560
No.

54:44.880 --> 54:46.000
Not my son.

54:49.440 --> 54:51.160
He'll still be as dead if Arthur does it.

54:51.240 --> 54:53.640
And part of him will always stay dead.

54:57.640 --> 54:59.800
-I swear to God…
-In whose house it took place…

54:59.880 --> 55:02.360
If my son pulls the trigger,

55:03.880 --> 55:08.120
I will bring this whole fucking
organization down around your ears.

55:20.800 --> 55:22.520
["Red Right Hand" playing]
